        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Uncompromising Security for Extra Thick Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShield your home with our robust Extra Thick Door Deadbolt. Engineered to withstand forceful entry, this lock is perfect for doors or gates ranging from <b>2-1/4\" - 4\" thick</b>. \r\nAs an ANSI Grade 1 deadbolt, it offers the highest level of residential security.\r\nIt has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. Available in 9  finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/2-1-4-inch-thick-door-single-cylinder-deadbolt-db60-61072\"><b>2-1/4 Inch Thick Door  Deadbolt</b></a> and <a href=\"/collections/thick-door-locks\"><b>Thick Door Locks</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese deadbolts are ANSI <b>Grade 1</b>--  toughest ANSI grade available. Sturdy construction paired with innovative features that provide added control, security and peace of mind.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Key Features</b> of DB60/61073 Thick Door Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Protection: Designed for doors 2-1/4\" to 4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Precision Fit: Adjustable latch for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>Simple Installation:  Fits 2-1/8\" and 1-1/2\" Bore Hole.</li>\r\n<li>Certifications:  ANSI A156.5, 2001, Grade 1 auxiliary lock.</li>\r\n<li>Easy Operation: Keyed exterior, thumbturn interior.</li>\r\n<li>Unyielding Strength: 1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core and reinforced strike.</li>\r\n<li>Advanced Security: Anti-pick shield and solid brass cylinder and trim.</li>\r\n<li>Convenience: Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/B60-install.pdf?v=1704262172\" target=\"new\"><b> Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DB60/61073 Thick Door Deadbolt Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<li>Housing Diameter: 2.420\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: 5-pin, Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: For use with <b>2-1/4\" to 4\" Thick Doors</b>. For standard 1-3/4\" thick doors use <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-maximum-security-grade-1-deadbolt-schlage-b60\"><b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Upgrade your home's defense with our Extra Thick Door Deadbolt.</b></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Thick Door Deadbolt, DB60/61073",
                "description": "For 2-1/4  to 4 inch thick doors or gates - single cylinder deadbolt will fit all standard door cutouts. ANSI Grade 1 deadbolt, operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. Available in 9 different finishes.",
